# Syringe Pump

A Python library for controlling syringe pumps.

## Installation

```bash
pip install syringe-pump
```

## Usage

```python
from syringe_pump import SyringePump

# Initialize the pump
pump = SyringePump(
    ip_address="http://your.pump.ip:5000",
    rinse_pump_array=your_pump_array,
    rinse_pump_number=1,
    drain_pump_number=2
)

# Load volume
pump.load_vol(10)  # Load 10 units of volume

# Rinse trough
pump.rinse_trough(20)  # Rinse with 20 units of volume
```

## Features

- Control syringe pump movements
- Load specific volumes
- Rinse trough functionality
- Integration with Agrow pump arrays

## Requirements

- Python 3.6+
- requests
- agrow-pumps

